{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10045","headline":"东郊纳凉忆左威卫李录事收昆季太原崔参军三首 二 · 楼頴","name":"东郊纳凉忆左威卫李录事收昆季太原崔参军三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纳凉每选地，近得青门东。\n林与缭垣接，池将沁水通。\n枝交帝女树，桥映美人虹。\n想是忘机者，悠悠在兴中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"楼頴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}